# Connecting a coding agent: read-only tools, proposals only.
Output docs/demo/mcp.gif
Source docs/demo/common.tape
Type "claude mcp add --scope user diskray -- diskray mcp"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "claude -p 'Use the diskray tools: why is my disk full, and what could I safely clear?'"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 90s
Type "diskray review"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 20s
Escape
Type "q"
